# outputDirectory is ".", so every tracked file in the repo root would
# otherwise be served publicly. Keep build-time source, data, and working docs
# off the CDN. (Vercel already excludes vercel.json and package.json itself.)
#
# *.md also covers DISTRIBUTION_KIT.md, which is untracked today but holds
# outreach contacts that must not become publicly readable if it ever lands.
tools/
data/
*.md
.github/
